-- ### Passo 3 — Criar uma segunda Gold: métricas diárias

```sql
CREATE TABLE gold_daily_metrics
STORED AS PARQUET AS
SELECT
  year, month, day,
  COUNT(*) AS transacoes,
  SUM(CASE WHEN is_fraud THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS fraudes
FROM silver_transactions
GROUP BY year, month, day;
```

